    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad5661764afadeccfee7236b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaf6b29d17c0d17b31649773a41c9995f963b5bb8c45fb8d89c79c740e5bc158",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:056579ac1fa24c064a51f172",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一起……一直、一直一起奔跑下去。\r\n所以，如果您能帮帮尤妮同学……\r\n能帮帮我最喜欢的尤妮同学的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d742f4f584bca74526bba818fda588300809684391484542e7a9cddd508c9f6d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7c44001f56b97f65c82d387",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我带着笑容与她许下约定，\r\n转身走出图书馆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "733b017fffc3ee2fa2c94cf9c0e58fe993991d9ed9a2bf24b2317a3fa1abb77b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:886e20d2cd2fc288784a0271",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今年的故事已经走到了尾声，\r\n崭新的故事即将开幕。\r\n不过——",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8232e2feaa1a9fc66fbd8e69db6d77458e8faa72fc9991145d5d1a1ab124123",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2684cb815d15e063bbce679",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我能够确信。\r\n新宇宙的故事——\r\n在明年，将会迎来最高潮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf6211cb57426138899889842b14342a7ef9ebbae623656731d917b23669ef53",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c7da562e4d46e1e7775cb4d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其他宇宙中，新宇宙在参加了『天皇赏（春）』\r\n之后，便消失了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "da50e7466e46e4ae15d7e848e778b10a419602a9e31d7de3d57d1f2da7495be1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6c8b604c5cd3d60adc9902a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，一个赛马娘怎么会唐突地“消失”？\r\n按照常理来说，这绝不可能。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d94b77d8b63b6787a45f31e840fac77e2b6abac091ead389946810c25ad2fce5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33005d25c8ab5acd8e30637c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要说的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3edbf35dbf2a6effbc18bcc6e8e685be9126973bf7ce494d8ba967d12fbba99b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21ccf9bba148ece53fdae79e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赛马娘店员",
      "source_fingerprint": "271f5c7e1771cbe9a5a9af0e239226bc6a1c6d2d4e46f11de3cae3fa27d18881",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:320a172ee498b44de0492b7e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谢谢光临～\r\n期待您的再度光临哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "315fb27712539bcf41b46a77e74cdcbf6b073645e57b61f27993c6b57aa903f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb7318d9eaa9eaa4b01e44e1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——“退役”。\r\n这样想的话，可能性倒是非常大。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af35a01e010551a2624818227da67e85d7958b326cffeaf22e6b108d2601853b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13878d14ffeea5bee35bd17f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“消失”についての検証",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1ffd3e834174e2ff42bbf5da9a52815003b27507402ef09b0043cc672d42af9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e33a50089bc68916781a45cb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——我们终于，来到了这命运的宙域。\r\n我们一面全力进行着训练，\r\n一面注意着是否会发生什么异常状况……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c736e8737aa86fd326adb45e990c2d531a8500f71145b8a962684268a988682b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d128390eaf83f10778496ac8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说实话——即便警戒到如此地步，\r\n我现在却仍觉得自己实在是掉以轻心了。\r\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "19c99136b6a8b298abaea6da7d33385cfe921bc572e457c2a6b5561cdb0eb59b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72f24855a168e08c990d2de3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就连自然对话也已经无法进行。\r\n我们不得不将所有精力全部都集中在感知新宇\r\n宙的异常上……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d644077b75e4db3faabead3ace99f89d5b9683e28c8358386864cc38aa7bc07",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d4a32ea6703538254c1d344",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…………",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5999fb8c439aedc310fc22e9b23faada72dc7422a48e55a6526491f7b19cc31",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd8fabca3e0fa90323e644ae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c1a97fd7c934b6ae622ea21",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员……\r\n这样做的话……\r\n真的能找到吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c728bb9857e2b11b9ce71e6d6f1c5cfa1d0cc0ce2be5dfd3b9ebe4cbf527d14f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efead6cf98aa91041f02600a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……正如她所说。\r\n说实话，我们也不知道到底能否察觉到那重大伤\r\n情的前兆，也不知到底能否预防……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c22fdc1d47741d36189f65748488ebd659bf4d830033de6dc46b22dc19f24fe3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:190cd1f6597f6aaf680ee918",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…………",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5999fb8c439aedc310fc22e9b23faada72dc7422a48e55a6526491f7b19cc31",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
