      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6004a81a6f3d147c94a27c2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…………",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5999fb8c439aedc310fc22e9b23faada72dc7422a48e55a6526491f7b19cc31",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:273d304c4076be915d4abeb5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们再度陷入沉默。\r\n这仿佛要将我们两人完全隔绝开来的空间，\r\n简直就是名副其实的“真空”……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fa4886a1c6f541283b3d0515152e711238c7f3bd5ace43bffda4f83deaa010d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb73ede0e58de7ca0eb113cf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（这样下去……不行。）",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e21b853880015b41cf3bfd8b98602d0f58786d7d0927de11ffaae362b60e8cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6ba6d532066999963145ad8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没有传导声音的媒介，\r\n语言也无法表达彼此的心意，\r\n唯有沉默存在于此……",
      "source_fingerprint": "09bda5e7c2cc76d7962a4f79abbd7df9e9e51a43fc470fb17be6de174729f86f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4700dd8121a33919d458314e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我突然意识到——\r\n这样的状态，简直和其他宇宙完全一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec5ca2413cfa4e9dd9e85b515fd91b95c6b88e1389006aefed0a8841babea8bf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f96b81aa6786d11bf6c9b7ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙是这样描述其他宇宙里的她的悲剧的——",
