    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54e8bde9dfc17bbdf4453685",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要做的事情与往日并没有什么不同。\r\n但没想到的是——这样的日常却会如此痛苦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8624d1b5ca3c61f013a6ceea21afdd51d8bb824056b26d654bc5c4471f771eda",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105117.json",
      "json_path": [
