      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也就是“BIBB”了。\r\n一旦超过两小时，就会“错杂”……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8571d3edda7c998d1256ba045fd31a6e15ebad7144cd20022ec84bdad0986b5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
