    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b927094e4ebf32e15bf86803",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一如既往地，她仍说着这些难懂的语言。\r\n我想，也许——",
      "source_fingerprint": "4183e6e99470cebca8f5ec2321658d8adedce57d0d88602689f9e813e3d53423",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8d10ef9796cd6a36bfafc52",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这些难以理解的语言——就是其他平行宇宙的我\r\n没能帮到新宇宙的原因。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e71111155aa01b68110b0cba885aa220409069e2de7724464dba0c193bfad735",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb66f7062e21030792135f39",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——无效沟通。\r\n因为我无法理解她话语的含义，\r\n这才导致悲剧循环往复。——但是！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a27f33f4439c6e187d75df12a09f6ae158449d22f0d9c9508c2f54a0946c0c4e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
