    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:127d5d501dae5c338bd5c755",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在的我已经明白了——交流所需的，\r\n不只是理解，还有“感受”。\r\n现在我已经能够感受到了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c9ec722bd1c0b74a1919f8233c169adee005da3569f3e66890dd2cd1632c192",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105117.json",
      "json_path": [
