        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e15396e6a4ec1c4c8609ea2e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在新宇宙这难以理解的语言之后所埋藏的，\r\n丰富的感情……！",
